<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6750"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skiller<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skiller<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 4:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Just heard on KAKE news someone has hacked into WSU school files on their computer system &#34;but&#34;,,, nothing was downloaded. very interesting to me,could this be BTK ?? maybe he wanted to back track to see if there be any clues to track him down<!--/Text--></td></tr>
