<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6946"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Featherw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Featherw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 5:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This question by BTK to Kevin Bright keeps me wondering... <BR> <BR>“At one time he just asked me, ‘Haven’t I seen you at the university?’ I had nothing to do with the university, so I said, ‘No,’” says Bright. <BR> <BR>Anyone know which UNIVERSITY BTK may have been referring to in this question to Kevin Bright? <BR> <BR>Thanks.. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
