<!--/Post: 6982-->
<!--Post: 7006--><!--Time: 1108129687-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7006"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Featherw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Featherw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 5:48 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks.  That is what I was thinking.  I just have to wonder why BTK would have said that to Kevin Bright. Seems like BTK did not have any idea as he was asking Kevin that question that Kevin would make it out alive.  Had BTK known that, he probably would not have given out that much info through a question.  I think there is some reason why he asked Kevin that. I do have to wonder why BTK thought he had seen Kevin at the UNIVERSITY? <BR> <BR>Thanks...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
