<!--Post: 7009--><!--Time: 1108131153-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7009"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skiller<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skiller<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 6:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Featherw thanks for your input on BTK and his home <BR>Do you understand where i am going with this ? If you get enough people together in saying where he might live will help in finding this coward maybe we can all get together here in kansas and hunt him down. After all Kechi is not a very big town. <BR>enough people together could go door to door on foot and cover the whole town in one day. Also did you know Kake news just said this morning, that wednesday night they would revail the contents of the cerial box and what the last post card said.  i cant wait,  I bet he feels like someone pissed in his toasties right now.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7009-->
<!--Post: 7047--><!--Time: 1108148863-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7047"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Featherw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Featherw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 11:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ha!  Skiller..I loved the way you ended your post above: &#39; I bet he feels like someone pissed in his toasties right now.&#39;... <BR> <BR>I agree.   <BR> <BR>WOW...I was not aware that KAKE had a specific time to reveal what the contents of the cereal box is.  I wonder why they are waiting until Wednesday. Could be that maybe they are waiting on some other piece of information to go along with it.  Who knows...but I can hardly wait either. <BR> <BR>Yah...I am all for getting together in Kansas and hunting him down. <BR> <BR>I get the feeling this guy DOES NOT live in Wichita, but within a city close to Wichita that also has streets called Iriquois and Arrowhead.  I live in another state, and there is still a section of town called &#34;Indian Hills&#34;..and Arrowhead street is near Iriquois street.  Interesting.   <BR> <BR>I understand there is an Arrowhead street in Kechi...would wonder if there is also an Iriqois street.  However, if these two streets do exist in Kechi as well as WICHITA, I would be willing to bet that Arrowhead does not turn onto Iriquois in Wichita... <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t know...Just surmising. <BR> <BR>Make it a plan.  Let&#39;s get a group together. <BR> <BR>Thanks...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7047-->
<!--Post: 7048--><!--Time: 1108149548-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7048"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 11:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->KAKE is only going to reveal what BTK typed on the postcard. KAKE doesn&#39;t know what is in the cereal box because KAKE never touched the box and WPD took possession of it. Since WPD asked KAKE not to show that section of the postcard that said what was inside the box, WPD must have finished their investigation and told KAKE go ahead and tell people what the postcard said. <BR>-Deb<!--/Text--></td></tr>
